    'Daisies, about 130 pieces. A small bouquet that never wilts, as an add-on or on its own.' => 'デイジー、約130ピース。枯れない小さなブーケは、添えても単品でも。',
    'A London double-decker bus, about 250 pieces. A small present for someone who loves travel.' => 'ロンドンの2階建てバス、約250ピース。旅行好きへのプチギフトに。',
